      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the \"new purpose\" thing isn't working though. the world doesn't want \"understanding\" or \"experience.\" it wants efficiency. it wants things that work instantly and cheap. i look at the way everything is built now and i just see a giant machine that has no slot for someone like me. it's like being a specialized tool that suddenly doesn't fit any of the new machines. there's just no use for it anymore. it's just taking up space.",
